  "id": 1114,
  "description": "## Calmshore\nCalmshore is a casual, non-competitive guild with no strict contribution requirements.\n\nWe accept players who enjoy relaxed incremental gameplay and want access to basic guild activities and mechanics (raid, challenge, repair maintenance, energizing Pools bonus) without pressure.  \n\nWe expect members to participate or contribute at their own pace — every little bit helps.\n\nJoining Requirement: Combat Lv. 60\n\nDue to prolonged non-participation from past members, members are now required to participate in any guild activity at least once every 3 weeks.\n\nKick: After 4 days of profile inactivity or 3 weeks of guild inactivity.\nYou will be sent a final notice before being kicked.\n\nRaid: Daily x2 - schedule two hours before raid.  \nSkybound Eden (Combat Lv. 70) (55 Minutes) - Floating Gardens of Aetheria\n\n1st Raid: PST 6pm, CST 8pm, EST 9pm, UTC 1am, AWST 9am  \n2nd Raid: PST 7am, CST 9am, EST 10am, UTC 2pm, AWST 10pm\n\nWeekly Energizing Pools activated on SAT and SUN (America) after 1st raid.\n\n(Saturday) PST 6:55pm, CST 8:55pm, EST 9:55pm, (Sunday) UTC 1:55am, AWST 9:55am  \n(Sunday) PST 6:55pm, CST 8:55pm, EST 9:55pm, (Monday) UTC 1:55am, AWST 9:55am\n\nOur Discord: https://discord.gg/Np2jQR4BCz\n\nCurrent Goal:  \nComplete Guild Challenges to afford weekly Guild Raids &amp; Energizing Pools  \nMaintain Repair Material in Stockpile\n\nHistory:  \n20251212 Guild Established, transferred from &#039;Harem Kings&#039; Guild  \n20260403 Completion of Energizing Pools\n\n### | GUILD BOARD |\n\n[GUILD MARKS]  \nEach completed Guild Challenge add 1 mark. Guild Marks are used to fund Raids (3 marks per raid) and Energizing Pools (5 marks per activation).\n\n[CONTRIBUTION]  \nContribute at your own pace.  \n- Join a raid. (Lv. 70 raid rewards 2.1k gold, 23k Combat EXP, 25k Guild Mastery EXP)\n- Contribute to Guild Challenge. We appreciate all the help we can get.\n- Repair Material Stockpile. Best to repair guild components as soon as possible - repair cost increases with the degree of deterioration.\n\n[REPAIR MATERIAL STOCKPILE]  \n(material requirement at 80% deterioration)\n\nMission Table  \n754 Oak Log  \n754 Birch Log  \n754 Banyan Log  \n1,006 Willow Log  \n754 Mahogany Log  \n754 Lead Bar  \n754 Steel Bar  \n\nEnergizing Pools  \n2,500 Spruce Log  \n2,500 Maple Log  \n1,500 Mystical Log  \n1,500 Iron Bar  \n1,500 Mercury Bar  \n1,500 Uranium Bar  \n\n### | Posted on 20260427 |\n\nIt&#039;s Monday and currently Windy in Floating Garden of Etheria, the weather will last for a day :P Hope you guys enjoy these recent new update.\n\nWelcome, Phoenixia, our newest member.\n\nAppreciate all of your help, this week Guild Challenge Contributors are:  \nMinutiae, Radiumgirl, p00pspanker, Phoenixia, GirthyPete, Wrenidall, YapaLeno, Owaeka, drtorao, MrArnih, Yaalt\n\nWe have a lot more people depositing into our stockpile. Thank you so much for watching out for our maintenance needs:\nProsektikos, Minutiae, MrArnih, Wrenidall, G333, drtorao.\n\n### | Posted on 20260505 |\n\nWe have Bipbi and DeadWings as our new members. Welcome!\n\nWe are good with Guild Challenges, we always has extra 4 Guild Marks per week.  \nThis week contributors are:  \nMinutiae, MrArnih, GirthyPete, Radiumgirl, p00pspanker, Wrenidall, Prosektikos, Yaalt, Bipbi, VelocityInSync.\n\nMrArnih &amp; G333 deposited to our stockpile last week.  \nWe are currently repairing the Mission Table. Most materials were readily available, I only had to fill in Banyan Log. Thank you very much for the smooth repair.  \nEnergizing Pool is currently at 85% condition.",
